 食友拿店家跟 初原 比，好笑 ⭕️\n\n⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️  以地區性五星評價\n值得特意來試試🍜拉麵。👍✨️\n祝生意興隆，感恩感謝。\n🌍2026.01。",null,[0,29]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/740925744195365498/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHYldGRlNtaFBSRUUxVWtoYWQyTjVNVTFpYW1ob1ducEJkR0pyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/740925744195365498/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHYldGRlNtaFBSRUUxVWtoYWQyTjVNVTFpYW1ob1ducEJkR0pyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/740925744195365498/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHYldGRlNtaFBSRUUxVWtoYWQyTjVNVTFpYW1ob1ducEJkR0pyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/740925744195365498/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHYldGRlNtaFBSRUUxVWtoYWQyTjVNVTFpYW1ob1ducEJkR0pyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/740925744195365498/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHYldGRlNtaFBSRUUxVWtoYWQyTjVNVTFpYW1ob1ducEJkR0pyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/740925744195365498/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhHYldGRlNtaFBSRUUxVWtoYWQyTjVNVTFpYW1ob1ducEJkR0pyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,19268,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGbWFFSmhPREE1Ukhad2N5MU1iamhoWnpBdGJrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x4c5cbbff2f61fc4c!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlFmaEJhODA5RHZwcy1MbjhhZzAtbkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGbWFFSmhPREE1Ukhad2N5MU1iamhoWnpBdGJrRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGbWFFSmhPREE1Ukhad2N5MU1iamhoWnpBdGJrRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xGbWFFSmhPREE1Ukhad2N5MU1iamhoWnpBdGJrRRILMGRUZE9DVFNWenMaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sRm1hRUpoT0RBNVJIWndjeTFNYmpoaFp6QXRia0USCzBkVGRPQ1RTVnpzIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARTPxhL_-7XEwqCzBkVGRPQ1RTVnpz\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d